<title>HONG KONG: Wanon Int'l year net loss HK$11.7 mln.</title>
<headline>Wanon Int'l year net loss HK$11.7 mln.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended June 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	 4.4 loss   vs 5.8 loss</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)  nil	  vs nil</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	nil	  vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			  11.70 loss vs 15.27 loss</p>
<p>    Turnover		   144.12     vs 100.02</p>
<p>    Company name	     Wanon International Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		December 23-27</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	 N/A</p>
<p>NOTE - Wanon International is a telephone maker.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is nil vs nil.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
